Claude Skill Registry - data archive
https://github.com/majiayu000/claude-skill-registry-data

This repository archives third-party Agent Skills collected by the Claude Skill
Registry pipeline (https://github.com/majiayu000/claude-skill-registry-core).

This repository does not grant a license to any archived content. Each archived
skill remains the work of its upstream author(s) under its own license. The
`author`, `source_url`, `license`, `copyright` and `distribution` fields in each
`<category>/<skill>/metadata.json`, and any LICENSE or NOTICE file inside a skill
directory, record the upstream terms, including copyleft and attribution
requirements. They are not a license grant from the registry maintainer.

A skill's SKILL.md is kept only when its recorded license is an open-source
license: OSI-approved licenses, copyleft included (for example GPL, AGPL, LGPL,
MPL, EPL), and open content licenses such as CC0, CC-BY and CC-BY-SA. Bundled
support files additionally require an approved compatible license. Skills with
no license, NOASSERTION, proprietary or "all rights reserved" terms, or
non-commercial / no-derivatives licenses keep only metadata.json, which
describes the skill and links to the upstream source; obtain those skills from
the source under their own terms.

